# only add build artifacts concerning coredns - no editor related files
coredns
coredns.exe
Corefile
build/
release/
vendor/

# SAZU: never let a private key or local test artifact end up committed.
# *.private is the BIND9 private-key-file format sazuctl/keygen writes --
# real key material, must never be checked in. The leading slashes on the
# binary names matter: unanchored, they'd also match the source
# directories plugin/sazu/cmd/sazuctl/ and .../sazu_stub_tld/.
/sazuctl
/sazu-stub-tld
*.private
*.db
*.zone
